OL,3,ATributes for Duran Duran guitarist Andy
OL,4,ATaylor after his death aged 65
OL,5,
OL,6,FSimon Le Bon, Sir Rod Stewart and Gary
OL,7,FKemp are among the pop stars who have
OL,8,Fpaid tribute to Duran Duran guitarist
OL,9,FAndy Taylor following his death at the
OL,10,Fage of 65.
OL,12,FTaylor co-wrote some of the group's
OL,13,Fbiggest hits including Save A Prayer,
OL,14,FRio and Girls On Film.
OL,16,FLe Bon and his bandmates paid tribute,
OL,17,Fsaying "he brought an indelible fire
OL,18,Fand swagger to our music", while Sir
OL,19,FRod remembered his "dear pal" and
OL,20,FSpandau Ballet's Kemp called him "a
OL,21,Fgreat player who set the tone for the
OL,22,F80s".
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,162,160,200,105,0,100
