OL,3,AVeruschka: Striking images of one of
OL,4,Athe world's first supermodels, who has
OL,5,Adied aged 87
OL,6,
OL,7,FVeruschka, the model and artist who
OL,8,Fbecame one of the first global fashion
OL,9,Fstars in the 1960s, has died at the age
OL,10,Fof 87.
OL,12,FShe became known as the striking
OL,13,Fsubject of fantastical photoshoots that
OL,14,Fhelped expand the boundaries of fashion
OL,15,Fand beauty in the 60s and 70s,
OL,16,Fappearing on the cover of American
OL,17,FVogue 13 times.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,164,160,200,105,0,100
PN,11915
SC,0015
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1795699129
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+j 55"k#j 5w;js1
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AVeruschka: Striking images of one of
OL,4,Athe world's first supermodels, who has
OL,5,Adied aged 87
OL,6,
OL,7,FVogue's obituary described her as "the
OL,8,Fshape-shifting supermodel who defined
OL,9,Fan era", explaining: "One of the
OL,10,Foriginal supermodels, Veruschka was
OL,11,Falso among fashion's great performance
OL,12,Fartists."
OL,14,FShe also made memorable appearances in
OL,15,Fclassic swinging 60s film Blow Up and
OL,16,F2006 James Bond movie Casino Royale.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/19
